[action_UC_Advance_EFSF_0079_To_AEUG_0087]
pos:90
text:Advance to AEUG 0087 [TP %{memory.ucEraTechBase+16200}]
text_zh:进入奥古[0087]时代 [科技点 %{memory.ucEraTechBase+16200}]
description:Complete all current-era mainline research and reach the required cumulative research points. Research points, credits, materials, units and completed research are retained.
description_zh:完成本时代全部主线科技后，仍需累计2700点科技。科技点不清零，后续时代门槛继续累加；保留资金、资源、现役部队与已完成研究。
displayType:action
buildSpeed:0s
ai_isDisabled:true
isVisible:if self.resource.FactionIndex==1010101
isLocked:if not (self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_BaseTech') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_AntiMSPlan') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_EarlyTypeMSDevelopmentPlan') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_OperationVDataRecoveryProject') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_GMDevelopmentPlan') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_T2_GMModularizationPlan') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_T2_Luna2TechnologyIntegrationPlan') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_T2_GundamNTCustomPlan') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_T2_GMKaiDevelopmentPlan') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_T2_GLineDevelopmentPlan') and self.globalTeamTags(includes='Tech_EFSF_0079_T2_GPProject')) or self.resource.TechPoint<memory.ucEraTechBase+16200 or not self.hasTags(includes='HQ_NotCaptured')
